  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Declare FULL rigor (TEST-MODIFYING override — code-review + adr-check unconditionally). Load ADR-038 + TEST-ARCHITECTURE.md + the existing `tests/integration/seam/` harness. Confirm `tests/integration/seam/Compose/` exists (create if absent). Read the 050/051/052/053 behaviors under test.</step>
